# Complete semantic translation of the historical ugen.wlcmd.
#
# The two historical event callbacks are automatic roots because their
# addresses escape through ugen_skel_events.  The seven bus_ops mappings to
# warlock_dummy cannot affect ugen, whose dev_ops has no bus_ops vector.
# Consequently this module needs no declarations for the historical policy.
#
# Attach initializes these fields before callback registration and device
# publication; their values do not subsequently change.
declare scheme-protects-data "constant after initialization" \
    ugen_skel_state_t::{ ugen_skel_dip ugen_skel_instance ugen_skel_hdl }
